{"uploader": "编程大佬陈悠秀", "uploader_id": "1730060979", "like_count": 109, "tags": ["人工智能", "学习", "教程", "claude code", "Codex安装", "Codex部署", "智能体", "AI助手", "保姆级教程", "Codex"], "thumbnail": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/259ec32006f3f90c19495569e8452f10e615753f.jpg", "description": "最近Codex的能力越来越全面，变成了Codex四大形态里最强一个。 Codex APP 比起 Claude Code，额度更高，功能更全，免费账户也能用。而且不会出现限速、封号、降智等问题，用过的小伙伴直呼真香。本期视频带来一个Codex APP的完整教程", "timestamp": 1780810352, "view_count": 6776, "comment_count": 83, "id": "BV1BVEs6LENZ_p11", "_old_archive_ids": ["bilibili 116707129561197_part11"], "title": "【2026最新Codex】Codex保姆级完整教程-Codex新手保姆级教程-最强AI助手！从入门到进阶，22分钟速通Codex！【附教程文档安装包】 p11 11_Codex MCP", "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1BVEs6LENZ?p=11"}, "formats": [{"url": "https://upos-hz-mirrorakam.akamaized.net/upgcxcode/49/92/38926289249/38926289249-1-30216.m4s?e=ig8euxZM2rNcNbdlhoNvNC8BqJIzNbfqXBvEqxTEto8BTrNvN0GvT90W5JZMkX_YN0MvXg8gNEV4NC8xNEV4N03eN0B5tZlqNxTEto8BTrNvNeZVuJ10Kj_g2UB02J0mN0B5tZlqNCNEto8BTrNvNC7MTX502C8f2jmMQJ6mqF2fka1mqx6gqj0eN0B599M=&uipk=5&gen=playurlv3&os=akam&trid=901eaeb1e9004140a4cba369316019cu&mid=3546568672151587&og=hw&oi=1733154763&platform=pc&deadline=1780907603&nbs=1&upsig=a925acb91803ad83236f41c6dc243cf9&uparams=e,uipk,gen,os,trid,mid,og,oi,platform,deadline,nbs&hdnts=exp=1780907603~hmac=895da58b8f326e45f134246cf47658182cb36704bf7d45fe5c4985fb52ba4681&bvc=vod&nettype=0&bw=65740&lrs=0&build=0&dl=0&f=u_0_0&qn_dyeid=c7c126320a1780890034aa7a6a266233&agrr=1&buvid=56CBBADE-6E37-C95A-FAC9-97160BE6D01C13885infoc&orderid=0,2", "ext": "m4a", "acodec": "mp4a.40.2", "vcodec": "none", "tbr": 65.594, "format_id": "30216", "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 65.594, "resolution": "audio only", "filesize_approx": 2259114, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/142.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xm